                    <legend>3. Which of the following are statically typed languages?</legend>

                    <div class="option">
                        <input type="checkbox" id="q3-ts" name="q3" value="ts">
                        <label for="q3-ts">TypeScript</label>
                    </div>
                    <div class="option">
                        <input type="checkbox" id="q3-ruby" name="q3" value="ruby">
                        <label for="q3-ruby">Ruby</label>
                    </div>
                    <div class="option">
                        <input type="checkbox" id="q3-go" name="q3" value="go">
                        <label for="q3-go">Go</label>
                    </div>
                    <div class="option">
                        <input type="checkbox" id="q3-php" name="q3" value="php">
                        <label for="q3-php">PHP</label>
                    </div>
